5:- [ ] **1 Tall narrow three-storey front over a garage base**: body 16 wide, y0..17 (+bay y4..16). Garage plinth stone y0..3 under three painted storeys (y4..16), parapet y18. Real construction: stone_bricks plinth, `siding` walls on z=7 x0..9 / x15, bay walls y4..16. P1 (z=7 wall, party walls, slabs y0/4/9/13/17), P2 (plinth+bay). Vocab: `rusticated`, `siding`.
6:- [ ] **2 Garage door and drive**: opening x3..6 y1..3 z4. Plum panelled door: crimson_planks fill with `crimson_trapdoor` closed (half=bottom, facing south) as raised panels at (3,1..3)...(6,1..3) in a 2×3 pattern, framed by a cream lintel `smooth_quartz_slab` row at (3..6,4,3) and ledge. Drive apron light_gray_concrete x3..6 z0..3 y0. P4 (door), P6 (apron). Vocab: `garageDoor`.
7:- [ ] **3 Stair of steps up to the entry (stoop)**: stair blocks `stone_brick_stairs` facing south at (11..13,1,2),(11..13,2,3),(11..13,3,4),(11..13,4,5); landing stone_bricks (11..13,4,6); stone_bricks filling under each tread to y0; cheeks stone_bricks x10/x14 (y1..4 stepping with the treads); iron_bars handrail on each cheek top. P2. Vocab: `stoop`.
8:- [ ] **4 Recessed entry porch with columns**: floor y4 (stand y5) x10..14 z7..9 stone_bricks, ceiling y9 plum coffer (crimson_planks with `crimson_trapdoor` inset), void y5..8; two columns at (10,5..8,7),(14,5..8,7); BODY side walls x=9, x=15 with cream wainscot (`smooth_quartz_slab` bottom y5 rows). Front wall z=7 omitted x10..14 y5..8. P2 (floor, ceiling, walls), P5 (columns). Vocab: `column`, `porchWainscot`.
10:- [ ] **6 Entry door + transom**: back wall z=10 x11..12 y5..7: `crimson_door` (two doors side by side, hinges outward, facing north) with hung `glass_pane` transom at (11..12,8,10); casing smooth_quartz stairs/slabs both sides; lantern hanging in porch at (12,8,8) (`lantern` hanging=true). P4. Vocab: `entryDoor`.
17:- [ ] **13 Tiny front garden behind an iron fence**: beds at plan SITE (soil `dirt`/`coarse_dirt` at y0, flowers y1: red_tulip, poppy, allium, azure_bluet, lilac, flowering_azalea shrub), `ironFence` along z=2: stone_bricks curb y0 + iron_bars y1 (+ `stone_brick_wall` posts every 3rd at y1), gaps x3..6 and x11..13; cheek wins at x10,x14. P6. Vocab: `ironFence`, `flowerBed`.
19:- [ ] **15 Deep back garden with deck**: deck posts (spruce_fence) at plan cells y3 (up to deck), deck `spruce_planks` top y4 x1..14 z31..35, joist `spruce_stairs`/`spruce_slab` fascia, railing `spruce_fence` y5 on z=35 (gap x6..8) and x1/x14 sides, step `spruce_stairs` at (6..8,3,36) facing south ascending north; lawn `grass_block` to y2, gravel path x7..8, retaining step `stone_brick_slab` y3 z44, upper garden y3. P6. Vocab: `deck`, `gardenBed`.
22:- [ ] **18 Chimney**: `bricks` stack x0..2 z12..13 y18..19, cap `stone_brick_slab` at y20, two `brick_wall` flue pots on the cap at (1,21,12),(1,21,13). P3. Vocab: `chimney`.
26:- [ ] **22 Exterior lights**: `lantern` hanging=true at (12,8,8) in the porch ceiling; `lantern` standing on the cheek tops at (10,5,6) and (14,5,6). P5.
27:- [ ] **23 Interior (rooms)**: entry hall + long stair along E party wall (x13..14 z11..16), parlour behind bay with fireplace x=1 z11..13, dining, kitchen to garden, upstairs bedrooms front/back, bathroom clawfoot tub, top-floor room under the roof with skylight. Built by the rooms' designers; P1 builds the shells, partitions, slabs, stairs.
28:- [ ] **24 Stair runs**: garage→main (13..14, y=z-25, z26..29), main→2 (13..14, y=5+(z-12), z12..16), 2→3 (13..14, y=10+(z-19), z19..22), `*_stairs` facing south bottom; slab holes as per RESERVED. P1 builds the holes, the rooms' designers the stairs.
